### Slack / der-dirigent status (no secrets; authorized=false without owner wallet)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/slack/status

### Status for platform owner wallet
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/slack/status?walletPubkey=7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC

### Delivery log — owner only (2xx)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/slack/deliveries?walletPubkey=7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC

### Notify — owner wallet; skipped when Slack secrets unset (still 2xx + log row)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/slack/notify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "text": "STAGE yellow decision needs owner review",
  "ownerDecisionId": 1
}

### Notify — non-owner must be 403
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/slack/notify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "NonOwner1111111111111111111111111111111111",
  "text": "should be forbidden"
}
